// Title: Raccine Uninstall
// ID: a31eeaed-3fd5-478e-a8ba-e62c6b3f9ecc
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2021-01-21
// Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
// Description: Detects commands that indicate a Raccine removal from an end system. Raccine is a free ransomware protection tool.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (((process.command_line like "*_taskkill *" and process.command_line like "*_RaccineSettings.exe*")) or ((process.command_line like "*_reg.exe*" and process.command_line like "*_delete*" and process.command_line like "*_Raccine Tray*")) or ((process.command_line like "*_schtasks*" and process.command_line like "*_/DELETE*" and process.command_line like "*_Raccine Rules Updater*")))
